
========================================================================
  PART 1: G_3 EMBEDDED IN G_5
========================================================================

  G_5: 12 classes. G_3: 2 classes.

  FIBER STRUCTURE:
  Inner class 0 (H=1): fiber size 9
    Fiber classes: [(0, 1), (1, 3), (2, 5), (4, 9), (5, 5), (6, 9), (7, 3), (10, 13), (11, 15)]
    Fiber connected in G_5: True
